redicate":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition","value":{"text":"Gas, rich in methane, which is produced by the fermentation of animal dung, human sewage or crop residues in an air-tight container. It is used as a fuel, to heat stoves, lamps, run small machines and to generate electricity. The residues of biogas production are used as a low-grade organic fertilizer. Biogas fuels do not usually cause any pollution to the atmosphere, and because they come from renewable energy resources they have great potential for future use.","language":"en","datatype":"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString"},"truncated":false}],"texts_clipped":false,"usage":[{"direction":"outgoing","evidence":[{"subject":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/832"},"predicate":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type"},"object":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"},"source_graph":{"kind":"iri","value":"urn:graph-verity:nl-ask-v1:evaluation:gemet"}},{"subject":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/832"},"predicate":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader"},"object":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/12011"},"source_graph":{"kind":"iri","value":"urn:graph-verity:nl-ask-v1:evaluation:gemet"}},{"subject":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/832"},"predicate":{"kind":"iri","value":"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"},"object":{"kind":"literal","value":"Gas, rich in methane, which is produced by the fermentation of animal dung, human sewage or crop residues in an air-tight container. It is used as a fuel, to heat stoves, lamps, run small machines and to generate electricity. The residues of biogas production are used as a low-grade organic fertilizer. Biogas fuels do not usually cause any pollution to the atmosphere, and because they come from renewable energy resource